{% comment %}
  ==========================================================================
  ZeroStick EXO manual v2: GAMES pages (Agent B, 2026-11-21)
  --------------------------------------------------------------------------
  Rendered by sections/zs-manual-v2.liquid with render zs-man2-games.
  Pages: the game support table, Black Ops II, Modern Warfare 4, Warzone,
  NBA 2K27, and one page for the other In progress games.

  Sources (never invent a value):
  - Status, gun detection and aim curve: EXO-LAUNCH-FEATURES.md section 2
    (per-game table) and the shared list snippets/zs-exo2-games.liquid.
  - Required in-game settings: the game packs' aimModel.gameSettings in
    C:\esp\wt-exe-build\dashboard\public\game-packs\cod-bo2.json,
    cod-mw4.json and cod-warzone.json (copied word for word).
  - "Starter values" sections are left out on purpose: no game pack ships
    measured starter numbers, and the manual never invents them.
  Rules: game names as text only (no logos), "Measured aim curve" only for
  Black Ops II, MW4 and Warzone, never imply Black Ops II runs on PS5.
  Plain-text comments only in here (no HTML tags inside Liquid comments).
  ==========================================================================
{% endcomment %}

<article class="m2-page" id="p-games" data-group="Games" data-title="Game support" data-time="3 min">
