  <section class="m2-sec" id="p-games--what-the-badges-mean">
    <h2>What the badges mean</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><span class="x2-badge x2-badge--ready">Ready</span> The game's settings are finished and tested.</li>
      <li><span class="x2-badge x2-badge--progress">In progress</span> You can play it today. Its settings are still being tuned.</li>
      <li><span class="x2-badge x2-badge--planned">Planned</span> You can make a config for it. It starts from basic settings.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>These match the sections you see when you make a new config. Nothing is locked: you can pick any game.</p>
  </section>

