    <p>Whatever its badge, every game gets: controller and mouse &amp; keyboard play, Mappings, Scripts and the 33 ready-made Scripts, Record script, the Anti-Recoil Lab (switched on by hand where there's no gun detection), Pass-through, Tournament Mode, lighting, and Aim Speed Match.</p>
