    <h1>NBA 2K27</h1>
    <p class="m2-get">Play NBA 2K27 with Auto green, which helps with shot timing.</p>
    <div class="m2-badges"><span class="x2-badge x2-badge--progress">In progress</span><span class="x2-badge x2-badge--plain">Controller</span><span class="m2-time">2 min</span></div>
