  <section class="m2-sec" id="p-games-nba-2k27--what-works">
    <h2>What works today</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><b>Auto green:</b> the EXO reads your shot meter and lets go of shoot for you. It learns your timing and keeps learning per player build. <a href="#p-auto-nba2k27-auto-green">Set up Auto green</a></li>
      <li>Button shooting and Pro stick shooting.</li>
      <li>Mappings, Scripts and lighting, like every game.</li>
    </ul>
    <p>On NBA configs, <b>Auto green</b> replaces the AI Scripts row. Needs HDMI through the EXO.</p>
